can be summarized as under:
(a) The defendant no.1 & 2 are the Architectures and are engaged in the business of real estate, including construction of properties in collaboration;
(b) One, Smt. Sheelu Khanna, an owner of the property bearing no.
B-1/33, admeasuring 100 sq. yds., Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi (hereinafter 'the said property') had entered into a collaboration agreement dated 13.03.2013 with the defendant no.1;

(i) Subsequently, the defendants informed the plaintiff that some dispute/differences had arisen between them and Smt. Sheelu Khanna;
(j) Smt. Sheelu Khanna, on account of failure of the defendants to complete the construction work as per the collaboration agreement, had decided to cancel the said agreement;
