(t) The cause of action arose: on 17.03.2013, when the agreement to sell with respect to the suit property was entered into; on different dates when the plaintiff made payments to the defendants;
on 02.09.2014 & 11.09.2014, when the defendants issued cheques for a sum of Rs.30 lakhs each; on 01.10.2014, when the defendants made a part-payment of Rs.1 lakh; on 13.10.2014, when the defendants vide email acknowledged the liability; and on 24.10.2014, when the cheques issued by the defendants were returned dishonoured;
(u) This Court has the territorial jurisdiction because the defendants reside and work for gain within its territorial limits and because the agreement to sell dated 17.03.2013 and confirmation agreement dated 17.03.2013 were executed within its local limits.

"It is, therefore, most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may be pleased to:
(a) Pass a decree of recovery of Rs.1,32,07,671/- in favour of the plaintiff and against the defendants v. Digitally signed Jagdish Balwani & Anr. SACHIN by SACHIN MITTAL Date:
